  "steps": [
    "Take a mixer jar.",
    "Add onion cubes, coriander leaves, mint leaves, garlic and green chilli.",
    "Mix it in coarse and keep it aside.",
    "Now heat oil in a kadai.",
    "Add jeera, cinnamon stick and cloves and onion chopped.",
    "Saute for 2 to 3 mins in high flame.",
    "Now add boiled green peas and paneer cubes.",
    "Saute for 4 mins in high flame.",
    "Now add mint coriander paste and saute until raw smell goes.",
    "Now add salt and rice and keep the flame medium.",
    "Mix it all slowly for 1 min and then keep the flame high and mix it slowly for another 1 min.",
    "Now serve it for 2 or 3 people and serve it with Skyr yogurt sprinkle of Kashmiri chilli powder.",
    "Enjoy it!!!"
